    "detailed_description": "Depths of Despair is a solo/group survivor-like, roguelite game. You simply use the WASD or arrow keys to move around and automatically slay enemies with abilities doing the work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Play solo or up to 4 players by hosting games online or via LAN.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Survive waves of enemies and bosses for 10-20 minutes on each map. Gain experience, unlock abilities, and upgrade them.<br />\r\n   <br />\r\n - Conquering maps will unlock new, harder ones.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Collect gold and unlock new characters with new starting abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Steam achievements!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you purchase the game, please leave a review, I'd love to hear your thoughts!",
    "about_the_game": "Depths of Despair is a solo/group survivor-like, roguelite game. You simply use the WASD or arrow keys to move around and automatically slay enemies with abilities doing the work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Play solo or up to 4 players by hosting games online or via LAN.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Survive waves of enemies and bosses for 10-20 minutes on each map. Gain experience, unlock abilities, and upgrade them.<br />\r\n   <br />\r\n - Conquering maps will unlock new, harder ones.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Collect gold and unlock new characters with new starting abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Steam achievements!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you purchase the game, please leave a review, I'd love to hear your thoughts!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Depths of Despair, a thrilling solo/multiplayer game where you must fight off waves of enemies to survive for a set amount of time. With each wave, the enemies become stronger and more challenging to defeat. Can you and your team hold out long enough?",
